### Create Location - COUNTRY
POST http://localhost:8080/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{myToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Portugal",
  "type": "COUNTRY"
}

### Create Location 2 - COUNTRY
POST http://localhost:8080/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{myToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
"name": "Spain",
"type": "COUNTRY"
}

### Create Location - REGION
POST http://localhost:8080/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{myToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Norte",
  "type": "REGION",
  "parentId": 1
}

### Create Location - CITY (filho de Norte)
POST http://localhost:8080/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{myToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Porto",
  "type": "CITY",
  "parentId": 3
}

### Create Location - MUNICIPALITY (filho de Porto)
POST http://localhost:8080/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{myToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Matosinhos",
  "type": "MUNICIPALITY",
  "parentId": 4
}

### Create Location - LOCALITY (filho de Matosinhos) — id 5
POST http://localhost:8080/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{myToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Leça da Palmeira",
  "type": "LOCALITY",
  "parentId": 5
}

### Create Location (Missing Token) (Should return 401 Unauthorized)
POST http://localhost:8080/locations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Portugal",
  "type": "COUNTRY"
}

### Create Location - tipo inválido (deve dar 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{myToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Portugal",
  "type": "CONTINENT"
}

### Create Location - nome em branco (deve dar 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{myToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "   ",
  "type": "COUNTRY"
}

### Create Location - parentId inexistente (deve dar 404)
POST http://localhost:8080/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{myToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Norte",
  "type": "REGION",
  "parentId": 999
}

### Create Location - hierarquia inválida (deve dar 422)
POST http://localhost:8080/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{myToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Espanha",
  "type": "COUNTRY",
  "parentId": 1
}

### Create Location - nome duplicado no mesmo pai (deve dar 409)
POST http://localhost:8080/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{myToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Norte",
  "type": "REGION",
  "parentId": 1
}

### Get Location por id
GET http://localhost:8080/locations/1

### Get Location - id inexistente (deve dar 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/locations/999

### Get Children of Location
GET http://localhost:8080/locations/1/children

### Get Hierarchy Path
GET http://localhost:8080/locations/2/path